  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WORLD ALLIANCE FOR BREASTFEEDING ACTION (WABA) &quot;Strengthening Maternity Proection &amp; Gender sensitisation/Mainstreaming- supporting optimal breastfeeding for better maternal and child health&quot;  2003-2008.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">aims to enable as many women as possible to breastfeed exclusively for 6 months and to continue breastfeeding for up to two years or beyond with appropriate complementary foods in order to improve maternal and child health. The overall goal of the WABA programme is to mobilise support for working women to combine the demands of motherhood, in particular, breastfeeding and appropriate child care w</narrative>
  </description>
